# Paste your Aiven CA Certificate here if using SSL CA verification
# Download it from Aiven Web Console:
# 1. Open your Aiven MySQL Service
# 2. In "Overview" tab -> "Connection information"
# 3. Click "Download CA Certificate" or "CA Certificate"
# 4. Save the content to 'aiven_ca.pem' in this directory.
